{"name": "Stella Sora", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Stella Sora is a free-to-play light-action fantasy RPG.</strong> Join the Trekkers to battle, conquer mysterious labyrinths called \"Monoliths,\" explore the vibrant continent of Nova, and uncover secrets buried beneath the sands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Top-Down, Build-Focused Gameplay \u2014 Craft Your Powerful Build</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experience top-down, squad-based combat and build your Trekker Squad. Challenge the Monoliths to unlock the Trekkers' full potential.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"640\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4813850/extras/fe2551175eefbb67e60b6252d07064a4.poster.avif?t=1792474166\" width=\"1090\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4813850/extras/fe2551175eefbb67e60b6252d07064a4.webm?t=1792474166\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4813850/extras/fe2551175eefbb67e60b6252d07064a4.mp4?t=1792474166\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Challenge Tough Events &amp; Bosses with Your Best Build and Compete on the Leaderboards</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Refine your Trekker Squad and take on high-difficulty events and bosses. Climb the leaderboards through calculated team composition and skillful execution, and prove that your squad is the mightiest force on the Nova Continent.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"640\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4813850/extras/2b6296660b4536bd5b9bff8e2e647f0f.poster.avif?t=1792474166\" width=\"1138\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4813850/extras/2b6296660b4536bd5b9bff8e2e647f0f.webm?t=1792474166\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4813850/extras/2b6296660b4536bd5b9bff8e2e647f0f.mp4?t=1792474166\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Branching Story Choices \u2014 Every Decision Has Consequences</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The fate of the Nova Continent lies in your hands! Every choice shapes the story and can even change the ending of the world. Who would have thought a gentle encounter or casual interaction could trigger a chain of events that brings ruin to Nova?!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"640\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4813850/extras/806e1842f8c6f1c554c2c7bf3a569075.poster.avif?t=1792474166\" width=\"1134\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4813850/extras/806e1842f8c6f1c554c2c7bf3a569075.webm?t=1792474166\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4813850/extras/806e1842f8c6f1c554c2c7bf3a569075.mp4?t=1792474166\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Heartlink System \u2014 Meet Diverse Trekkers</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Forge deep bonds with a cast of vivid Trekkers, each with a unique personality. Chat, go on dates, and send gifts through Heartlink to unlock their private side stories as your affinity grows.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"640\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4813850/extras/be710db63d1fc1db1e9dc33f64427b12.poster.avif?t=1792474166\" width=\"1134\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4813850/extras/be710db63d1fc1db1e9dc33f64427b12.webm?t=1792474166\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4813850/extras/be710db63d1fc1db1e9dc33f64427b12.mp4?t=1792474166\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Casual Minigames for Relaxed Fun</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Stella Sora features a variety of fun casual minigames! After intense Monolith expeditions, enjoy flexible gameplay for any mood and earn rewards with ease.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"640\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4813850/extras/66ccc24dc47e7927207557ea9b591e72.poster.avif?t=1792474166\" width=\"1138\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4813850/extras/66ccc24dc47e7927207557ea9b591e72.webm?t=1792474166\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4813850/extras/66ccc24dc47e7927207557ea9b591e72.mp4?t=1792474166\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Tales of Love and Hope Await!</strong></p> </div>", "short_desc": "Stella Sora is a free-to-play light-action fantasy RPG. Join the Trekkers to battle, conquer mysterious labyrinths called \"Monoliths,\" explore the vibrant continent of Nova, and uncover secrets buried beneath the sands.", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4813850/591ede97dbcf67b47a12d2f0e291fd9800245791/header.jpg?t=1792474166", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Cute", "Funny", 